  ('ad29aa65-ed51-5c16-94a4-f50c4809ba47', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222221', 'short', 'so that you can build the conversation from that point that point 指的是什么？', null, '', '', '英语2/长难句6-状语从句【预习版】.pdf', 34, true, 208, null),
  ('fdf9448b-59d2-5dd6-b6d4-84a4eeaeb46e', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222221', 'short', 'when you meet a person for the first time 4 主句 make an effort 真题演练一 35', null, '', '', '英语2/长难句6-状语从句【预习版】.pdf', 34, true, 209, null),
  ('0a2f1af6-058c-5dd0-898b-d3e7438d45e9', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222221', 'mcq', '_______ When you meet a person for the first time, make an effort to find the things which you and that person have in common so that you can build the conversation from that point. When you start conversation from there and then move outwards, you''ll find all of a sudden that the conversation becomes a lot easier.', '[{"key": "A", "text": "Just say it"}, {"key": "B", "text": "Be present"}, {"key": "C", "text": "Pay a unique compliment"}, {"key": "D", "text": "Name, places, things"}, {"key": "E", "text": "Find the“me too\"s F.Skip the small talk"}]'::jsonb, 'E', '题目描述的是初次见面时，应努力寻找与对方的共同点（things which you and that person have in
common），并以此为基础展开对话。这种方法会使对话变得更轻松自然。E选项“Find the ''me too''s” 直接
